# =============================================================================
# 字节精确性优先 / Byte-exactness first
# =============================================================================
#
# 本仓库的内容由 MANIFEST.txt 中的 SHA256 **逐字节**自校验
# （验证工具：tools/verify_package.py）。
#
# Git 在 Windows 上默认启用 core.autocrlf=true，会在检出时把 LF 转换为 CRLF。
# 这会改变文件的字节内容 —— 从而让每一个 Windows 用户的校验都必然失败，
# 即使文件本身从未被修改。
#
# 因此本仓库**全局禁用行尾转换**，确保任何平台上的 clone 都与发布状态
# 逐字节一致。
#
# This repository is byte-verified by the SHA256 sums in MANIFEST.txt
# (tool: tools/verify_package.py). Git's default core.autocrlf=true on Windows
# rewrites LF to CRLF on checkout, changing file bytes and making every
# Windows-side verification fail even though nothing was modified.
# Line-ending conversion is therefore disabled globally.
# =============================================================================

* -text

# 语言可视化 / Linguist 覆盖：让 GitHub 正确识别
*.ps1   linguist-language=PowerShell
*.asm   linguist-language=Assembly
*.lst   linguist-language=Assembly

# 明确排除二进制（本仓库不应出现，仅作双保险）
# Explicitly exclude binaries (should never exist here; belt and braces)
*.bin   binary
*.rom   binary
*.hex   binary
*.dmp   binary
*.sys   binary
*.exe   binary
*.dll   binary
*.md3   binary
*.pdf   binary
